":1384603,"title":"","content":"I haven't got a wiki, but I recently moved my game over to Discord (as we're all in lockdown). I've found it useful because I can have, as well as a chatroom, stuff like a channel with pictures of PCs, a channel with pictures of NPCs, a channel with session summaries, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-29T20:10:47-07:00","id":1384765,"title":"","content":"\u200b<a href=\"http://www.rpgclinic.com/fullparty\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.rpgclinic.com/fullparty</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25272-cypheriel","name":"Cypheriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T00:27:13-07:00","id":1384795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cypheriel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1363966-has-anyone-actually-created-a-wiki-for-their-campaign?p=1384765#post1384765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b[snip]</div> </div> </div> </d